ccess, limited demo, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you do purchase the game, glad to have you on board and let's see where the boulder rolls.</p>","developers":["O\u00dc Vaba T\u00f5lge"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006450/f4724ef616e411a8a1a43cb9d1a3f5a2b40d3e63/header.jpg?t=1767184747","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Xeon E5-1630 v4 3,7GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 2060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any on-board chip will work.<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> The above requirements have been verified to work, but it is possible the game will work on lower specs.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4006450/702919863/087e7ecefbd5482e9626d960f27479bb9899b703/1758820830/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758822821","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4006450/702919863/087e7ecefbd5482e9626d960f27479bb9899b703/1758820830/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758822821","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4006450/702919863/087e7ecefbd5482e9626d960f27479bb9899b703/1758820830/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758822821","id":257204147,"name":"Sisyphus Endures","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257204147/fa82cdaecbc48abd0406d61d75b4d0ebdc264df6/mo